# Netlify redirect rules — force the single canonical host (https://cohostdordogne.com)
# so Google stops indexing www / http duplicates of every page.
# See README.md "Canonical host" section if deploying elsewhere.

# Serve search-engine site-verification files directly on every host/scheme —
# verification bots check the exact host you registered the site under and
# don't treat a redirect as a pass, so these must not be canonicalized away.
https://www.cohostdordogne.com/BingSiteAuth.xml  /BingSiteAuth.xml  200!
http://www.cohostdordogne.com/BingSiteAuth.xml   /BingSiteAuth.xml  200!
http://cohostdordogne.com/BingSiteAuth.xml       /BingSiteAuth.xml  200!

https://www.cohostdordogne.com/*  https://cohostdordogne.com/:splat  301!
http://www.cohostdordogne.com/*   https://cohostdordogne.com/:splat  301!
http://cohostdordogne.com/*       https://cohostdordogne.com/:splat  301!
